<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>清邁清萊美食總圖</name><Folder><name>夜市/長康路</name><Placemark><name>Lemongrass 泰式餐廳</name><description><![CDATA[Lemongrass Thai Cuisine<br>ร้านอาหารเลมอนกราส<br><br>必點：Khao Soi、香蕉捲<br>民宿走路就到，觀光客友善、有冷氣<br>價格：150～250 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-22:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lemongrass%20Thai%20Cuisine%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9985,18.7845,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Anusarn 夜市美食區</name><description><![CDATA[Anusarn Market<br>ตลาดอนุสาร<br><br>必點：海鮮燒烤、泰式小吃、芒果糯米<br>有屋頂的大型美食區，下雨也能逛；6人各點各的最方便<br>價格：100～300 銖/人<br>營業：約17:00-23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Anusarn%20Market%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.0012,18.7826,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kalare 夜市美食廣場</name><description><![CDATA[Kalare Night Bazaar Food Court<br>กาแลไนท์บาซาร์<br><br>必點：泰式熱炒、Khao Soi、果汁<br>美食廣場買餐券制，旁邊有免費傳統舞蹈表演<br>價格：80～200 銖/人<br>營業：約17:00-23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kalare%20Night%20Bazaar%20Food%20Court%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.001,18.7845,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Khao Soi Islam（回教 Khao Soi）</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Soi Islam<br>ข้าวซอยอิสลาม<br><br>必點：雞肉／牛肉 Khao Soi、香料飯 Biryani<br>穆斯林社區老店，不含豬肉；離民宿走路約10分鐘<br>價格：60～120 銖/人<br>營業：約08:00-17:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Soi%20Islam%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.001,18.7868,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ploen Ruedee 夜市美食廣場</name><description><![CDATA[Ploen Ruedee Night Market<br>ตลาดเพลินฤดี<br><br>必點：各國小吃、精釀啤酒、現場音樂<br>露天美食廣場＋現場音樂，離民宿走路幾分鐘；部分攤位只收現金<br>價格：100～300 銖/人<br>營業：約週一～六 傍晚～23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ploen%20Ruedee%20Night%20Market%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.0012,18.787,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rasik 新派泰菜</name><description><![CDATA[Rasik Local Kitchen<br><br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：烤牛骨髓配南薑醬<br>晚上才開、需預約（二休）｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：300～500 銖/人<br>營業：17:00-22:00（二休；需訂位，僅14-16席）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rasik%20Local%20Kitchen%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.001,18.7835,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>濱江區</name><Placemark><name>The Riverside 河畔餐廳</name><description><![CDATA[The Riverside Bar & Restaurant<br>เดอะ ริเวอร์ไซด์<br><br>必點：泰式料理、調酒、現場樂團<br>河景＋現場樂團，晚上氣氛好<br>價格：250～500 銖/人<br>營業：約11:00-24:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=The%20Riverside%20Bar%20%26%20Restaurant%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.0045,18.788,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Huan Soontaree 河畔泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Huan Soontaree<br>เฮือนสุนทรี<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：泰北前菜拼盤、炸魚釀豬肉<br>國寶級民歌手開的餐廳，晚上有現場演唱，可容納350人<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：16:30-23:00（日休）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Huan%20Soontaree%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.003,18.804,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Woo 花園咖啡</name><description><![CDATA[Woo Cafe & Art Gallery<br>วู คาเฟ่<br><br>必點：甜點、花茶、泰式餐點<br>花園＋藝廊＋咖啡，網美拍照店<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-22:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Woo%20Cafe%20%26%20Art%20Gallery%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.005,18.793,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Khao Soi Lam Duan（Faham）</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Soi Lam Duan Faham<br>ข้าวซอยลำดวนฟ้าฮ่าม<br><br>必點：Khao Soi、Khanom Jeen<br>Faham 的 Khao Soi 一條街代表店，在地老字號<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：早上～下午<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Soi%20Lam%20Duan%20Faham%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.01,18.809,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>古城</name><Placemark><name>Roti Pa Day 泰式煎餅</name><description><![CDATA[Roti Pa Day<br>โรตีป้าเดย์<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：香蕉 Roti、煉乳 Roti<br>泰巴混血阿姨經營近40年的路邊攤；從民宿走去塔佩門的路上<br>價格：30～80 銖/人<br>營業：傍晚～深夜（路邊攤）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Roti%20Pa%20Day%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9963,18.7878,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Guay Jub Chang Moi 粿汁</name><description><![CDATA[Guay Jub Chang Moi Tat Mai<br>ก๋วยจั๊บช้างม่อยตัดใหม่<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：粿汁、脆皮豬肉飯、春捲<br>粿汁湯頭胡椒香，脆皮豬必點；15:00 前要到<br>價格：80～150 銖/人<br>營業：10:00-15:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Guay%20Jub%20Chang%20Moi%20Tat%20Mai%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.999,18.7915,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Sanpakoi 泰式米線 Kanom Jeen</name><description><![CDATA[Sanpakoi Kanomjeen<br>ขนมจีนสันป่าข่อย<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：泰北米線 Khanom Jeen Nam Ngiao<br>在地人早餐，米線配番茄豬骨湯 Nam Ngiao<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：週一～六 06:00-15:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sanpakoi%20Kanomjeen%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9995,18.7925,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>瓦洛洛市場（Kad Luang）</name><description><![CDATA[Warorot Market (Kad Luang)<br>ตลาดวโรรส (กาดหลวง)<br><br>必點：泰北香腸 Sai Ua、炸豬皮、辣椒醬 Nam Prik Noom<br>清邁最老的市場，買伴手禮（香腸、豬皮、乾果）<br>價格：50～150 銖/人<br>營業：約06:00-18:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Warorot%20Market%20%28Kad%20Luang%29%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.0006,18.7903,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>★ Akha Ama Coffee</name><description><![CDATA[Akha Ama Coffee (The New Original)<br>อาข่า อ่ามา คอฟฟี่<br><br>必點：單品手沖、拿鐵<br>阿卡族咖啡，必去<br>價格：80～150 銖/人<br>營業：08:00-17:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Akha%20Ama%20Coffee%20%28The%20New%20Original%29%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9935,18.792,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>林老五魚丸麵</name><description><![CDATA[Lim Lao Ngow<br>หลิมเหล่าโหงว<br>⭐ 米其林推薦<br>必點：魚丸麵、炸魚皮<br>華人老字號魚丸麵，早上開到中午<br>價格：50～100 銖/人<br>營業：約07:00-14:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lim%20Lao%20Ngow%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9935,18.7955,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Khao Soi Khun Yai 奶奶咖哩麵</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Soi Khun Yai<br>ข้าวซอยคุณยาย<br><br>必點：雞腿 Khao Soi<br>很多人心中清邁最好吃的 Khao Soi，賣完就收，早點去<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-14:00（日休）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Soi%20Khun%20Yai%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9858,18.7953,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>牛仔帽阿姨豬腳飯</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Kha Moo Chang Phueak (Cowboy Hat Lady)<br>ข้าวขาหมูช้างเผือก<br><br>必點：滷豬腳飯 Khao Kha Moo<br>Anthony Bourdain 去過而爆紅，北門夜市最長的排隊攤<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：傍晚～深夜<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Kha%20Moo%20Chang%20Phueak%20%28Cowboy%20Hat%20Lady%29%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9867,18.7957,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>SP 烤雞</name><description><![CDATA[SP Chicken<br>เอสพี ไก่ย่าง<br><br>必點：泰式烤雞、青木瓜沙拉<br>在地人愛的烤雞，逛帕辛寺順便吃<br>價格：80～150 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-17:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SP%20Chicken%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9815,18.788,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Huen Phen 泰北老店</name><description><![CDATA[Huen Phen<br>เฮือนเพ็ญ<br><br>必點：泰北拼盤、Khao Soi、Gaeng Hang Lay<br>在地人也愛的泰北菜老店，菜色齊全適合第一次吃泰北菜<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：午餐＋晚餐<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Huen%20Phen%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.986,18.7845,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Baan Landai 精緻泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Baan Landai Fine Thai Cuisine<br>บ้านลานดาย<br>⭐ 米其林推薦<br>必點：蘭納皇家料理<br>精緻擺盤、環境優雅，需預約<br>價格：400～800 銖/人<br>營業：約11:00-22:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Baan%20Landai%20Fine%20Thai%20Cuisine%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.987,18.79,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kung Yim 烤大蝦吃到飽</name><description><![CDATA[Kung Yim<br>กุ้งยิ้ม<br><br>必點：開背烤河蝦、鳳螺、魷魚<br>有冷氣，烤大蝦是招牌；6人先訂位<br>價格：399～599 銖/人<br>營業：約17:00-23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kung%20Yim%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.992,18.789,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>週日步行街小吃</name><description><![CDATA[Sunday Walking Street<br>ถนนคนเดินวันอาทิตย์<br><br>必點：香腸、烤雞、芒果糯米、炸豬皮<br>清邁最大夜市，寺廟院子裡有小吃廣場<br>價格：100～300 銖/人<br>營業：週日 16:00-23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Sunday%20Walking%20Street%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.988,18.788,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Kiti Panit 老洋房泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Kiti Panit<br>กิติพานิช<br><br>必點：泰北咖哩、涼拌、烤肉<br>百年老商行改建，泰北菜擺盤精緻、環境好，6人聚餐適合<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：午餐＋晚餐<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kiti%20Panit%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9955,18.7878,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Lert Ros 烤魚</name><description><![CDATA[Lert Ros<br>เลิศรส<br><br>必點：鹽烤魚、青木瓜沙拉、烤豬頸肉<br>塔佩門旁巷子裡的伊善烤魚老店，便宜道地<br>價格：80～200 銖/人<br>營業：午餐～傍晚<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lert%20Ros%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9925,18.788,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Aroon Rai 泰北咖哩老店</name><description><![CDATA[Aroon Rai<br>อรุณไร<br><br>必點：Gaeng Hang Lay 豬肉咖哩、Khao Soi<br>開了幾十年的泰北菜老店，觀光客和在地人都多<br>價格：80～200 銖/人<br>營業：午餐＋晚餐<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Aroon%20Rai%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9935,18.7866,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Dash! 柚木屋泰菜</name><description><![CDATA[Dash! Teak House<br>แดช ทีคเฮาส์<br><br>必點：泰式咖哩、炒菜、調酒<br>柚木老屋＋庭院，晚上有現場音樂，適合想坐久一點<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：約11:00-23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dash%21%20Teak%20House%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9938,18.7865,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Somphet 早市</name><description><![CDATA[Somphet Market<br>ตลาดสมเพชร<br><br>必點：粥、糯米飯、熟食、水果<br>古城裡的在地市場，早餐和水果很方便<br>價格：40～100 銖/人<br>營業：早上～傍晚（早上最熱鬧）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Somphet%20Market%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9928,18.7925,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Jok Somphet 豬肉粥</name><description><![CDATA[Jok Somphet<br>โจ๊กสมเพชร<br><br>必點：豬肉粥 Jok、油條<br>清邁有名的粥店，早餐或宵夜都可以<br>價格：40～80 銖/人<br>營業：早上～深夜<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jok%20Somphet%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.993,18.793,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Fern Forest 森林咖啡</name><description><![CDATA[Fern Forest Cafe<br>เฟิร์น ฟอเรสต์ คาเฟ่<br><br>必點：蛋糕、早午餐、咖啡<br>被綠植包圍的庭院咖啡，蛋糕有名<br>價格：120～250 銖/人<br>營業：約08:30-20:30<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Fern%20Forest%20Cafe%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9835,18.7945,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Nam Ngiao Yong 泰北米線</name><description><![CDATA[Nam Ngiao Yong<br>น้ำเงี้ยวยง<br>⭐ 米其林推薦<br>必點：Khanom Jeen Nam Ngiao 番茄排骨湯米線<br>米其林有收錄的市場米線攤｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：每日 08:00-17:30<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nam%20Ngiao%20Yong%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9888,18.8062,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Neng 甕烤豬</name><description><![CDATA[Neng Earthen Jar Roast Pork<br><br><br>必點：甕烤豬、Nam Tok Moo、泰北香腸<br>用陶甕慢烤的豬肉，在地人氣店｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：80～150 銖/人<br>營業：午餐～傍晚（出發前確認）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Neng%20Earthen%20Jar%20Roast%20Pork%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.0035,18.7975,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Busarin Cuisine</name><description><![CDATA[Busarin Cuisine<br><br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：泰式家常菜<br>米其林必比登｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：50～200 銖/人<br>營業：週一～六 11:00-15:00（資料不一，出發前確認）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Busarin%20Cuisine%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.003,18.7968,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Saiyut &amp; Doctor Sai 皇家泰菜</name><description><![CDATA[Saiyut & Doctor Sai Kitchen<br><br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：皇家前菜拼盤<br>精緻擺盤的皇家泰菜（三休）｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：10:00-21:00（三休；需預約）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Saiyut%20%26%20Doctor%20Sai%20Kitchen%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9975,18.8048,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>CHAWEE 私房泰菜</name><description><![CDATA[CHAWEE<br><br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：季節菜單、家傳食譜<br>2026 必比登新入選，需預約（二休）｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：300～500 銖/人<br>營業：11:00-15:00、17:00-21:00（二休，來源為二手資料）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=CHAWEE%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9925,18.804,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Magnolia 新派泰菜</name><description><![CDATA[Magnolia Cafe<br>แมกโนเลีย คาเฟ่<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：風乾魷魚配花生醬、烤豬頸肉<br>晚上營業（日休）｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：250～450 銖/人<br>營業：約17:00-22:00（資料不一，建議先訂位）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Magnolia%20Cafe%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.0025,18.7965,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>古城南/Wualai</name><Placemark><name>Big Big Shabu 海鮮吃到飽</name><description><![CDATA[Big Big Shabu<br>บิ๊กบิ๊ก ชาบู<br><br>必點：活蝦、生蠔、火鍋燒烤吃到飽<br>清邁最紅平價海鮮自助，戶外座位、熱鬧<br>價格：220～399 銖/人<br>營業：約16:00-24:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Big%20Big%20Shabu%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.986,18.779,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>週六步行街小吃</name><description><![CDATA[Wualai Saturday Walking Street<br>ถนนคนเดินวัวลาย<br><br>必點：烤肉串、泰北香腸、芒果糯米、椰子冰<br>銀飾街＋小吃，只有週六<br>價格：100～300 銖/人<br>營業：週六 17:00-22:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Wualai%20Saturday%20Walking%20Street%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.987,18.779,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Euang Kam Sai 百年泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Euang Kam Sai<br>เอื้องคำสาย<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：泰式米飯卷、泰北牛肉咖哩<br>家族老店，傳統泰北家常菜<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：11:00-21:00（一休）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Euang%20Kam%20Sai%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.989,18.774,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>清邁門夜市小吃</name><description><![CDATA[Chiang Mai Gate Night Market<br>ตลาดประตูเชียงใหม่<br><br>必點：豬腳飯、芒果糯米、炸物、果汁<br>在地人吃晚餐的小吃夜市，攤位多、便宜<br>價格：50～150 銖/人<br>營業：每天 傍晚～深夜<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chiang%20Mai%20Gate%20Night%20Market%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.987,18.781,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>清邁門豬腳飯</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Kha Moo Chiang Mai Gate<br>ข้าวขาหมูประตูเชียงใหม่<br><br>必點：滷豬腳飯 Khao Kha Moo<br>和北門牛仔帽阿姨齊名的南門豬腳飯<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：傍晚～深夜<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Kha%20Moo%20Chiang%20Mai%20Gate%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9873,18.7812,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>寧曼</name><Placemark><name>Khao Soi Mae Sai</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Soi Mae Sai<br>ข้าวซอยแม่สาย<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：牛肉／雞肉 Khao Soi<br>米其林必比登 Khao Soi，中午人多早點去<br>價格：60～100 銖/人<br>營業：週一～六 08:00-16:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Soi%20Mae%20Sai%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.979,18.801,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Huen Muan Jai 蘭納小屋泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Huen Muan Jai<br>เฮือนม่วนใจ<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：泰北前菜拼盤、Gaeng Hang Lay 豬肉咖哩<br>木造蘭納小屋，6人點一桌泰北菜最划算<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：11:00-21:00（三休）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Huen%20Muan%20Jai%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9795,18.8005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ginger Farm Kitchen</name><description><![CDATA[Ginger Farm Kitchen<br>จิงเจอร์ ฟาร์ม คิทเช่น<br>⭐ 米其林推薦<br>必點：農場沙拉、泰北咖哩<br>農場直送食材、綠植環繞<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-22:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ginger%20Farm%20Kitchen%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9675,18.8005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ristr8to 拉花冠軍咖啡</name><description><![CDATA[Ristr8to<br>ริสเตรตโต้<br><br>必點：拉花拿鐵、單品<br>世界拉花冠軍的咖啡店<br>價格：80～180 銖/人<br>營業：約07:00-19:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ristr8to%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.968,18.799,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Graph 咖啡</name><description><![CDATA[Graph Cafe<br>กราฟ คาเฟ่<br><br>必點：特調咖啡、創意飲品<br>清邁精品咖啡代表之一，創意特調很有名<br>價格：120～200 銖/人<br>營業：約09:00-17:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Graph%20Cafe%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9677,18.8005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Rustic &amp; Blue 早午餐</name><description><![CDATA[Rustic & Blue<br>รัสติก แอนด์ บลู<br><br>必點：早午餐、自家農場食材<br>寧曼路人氣早午餐<br>價格：200～350 銖/人<br>營業：約08:30-17:30<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rustic%20%26%20Blue%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.97,18.7965,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tong Tem Toh 泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Tong Tem Toh<br>ต๋อง เต็ม โต๊ะ<br><br>必點：泰北香腸、辣椒醬配蔬菜、烤豬頸肉、糯米飯<br>寧曼最紅的平價泰北菜，中午、晚上都要排隊<br>價格：100～250 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-22:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Tong%20Tem%20Toh%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9688,18.7975,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Cherng Doi 炭烤雞</name><description><![CDATA[Cherng Doi Roast Chicken<br>เชิงดอย ไก่ย่าง<br><br>必點：炭烤雞、青木瓜沙拉、糯米飯<br>有人說比 SP Chicken 更香更脆皮，早點去<br>價格：100～200 銖/人<br>營業：午餐～傍晚<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cherng%20Doi%20Roast%20Chicken%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9705,18.7985,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Pun Pun 素食（Wat Suan Dok）</name><description><![CDATA[Pun Pun Vegetarian<br>ปันปัน<br><br>必點：素 Khao Soi、有機蔬食<br>寺廟裡的有機素食餐廳，吃素的朋友首選<br>價格：80～150 銖/人<br>營業：約08:00-16:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pun%20Pun%20Vegetarian%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.969,18.788,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>郊區</name><Placemark><name>SANAE 清真牛肉料理</name><description><![CDATA[SANAE Thai Cuisine<br><br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：牛油炒飯配醃蛋黃、酸辣牛小排湯<br>在素帖山腳文青村旁，可搭配逛 Baan Kang Wat<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：11:30-21:00（一休）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=SANAE%20Thai%20Cuisine%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.95,18.7767,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Meena 五色飯</name><description><![CDATA[Meena Rice Based Cuisine<br>มีนา ไรซ์ เบส คูซีน<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：五色飯、泰北魚蓉沙拉<br>稻田旁網美餐廳，需包車<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：約10:00-20:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Meena%20Rice%20Based%20Cuisine%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.105,18.759,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Krua Lawng Khao 泰北家常菜</name><description><![CDATA[Krua Lawng Khao<br>ครัวลองข้าว<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：泰北家常菜<br>湄林區在地家常菜，搭配湄林山谷一日遊<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：午餐為主<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Krua%20Lawng%20Khao%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.944,18.917,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Gongkham 泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Gongkham Maerim<br>ก้องคำ แม่ริม<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：青辣椒醬配炸豬肝、泰北香腸<br>湄林區，搭配湄林山谷或叢林飛索一日遊<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：09:00-21:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gongkham%20Maerim%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.945,18.915,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Jing Jai 週末農夫市集</name><description><![CDATA[Jing Jai Market<br>ตลาดจริงใจ<br><br>必點：有機蔬果、早餐、咖啡、手作<br>週末才有的文青農夫市集，11/15（日）早上可順路<br>價格：100～250 銖/人<br>營業：週六、日 早上～中午<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jing%20Jai%20Market%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>98.9985,18.807,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Dan 海南雞飯（San Sai）</name><description><![CDATA[Dan Chicken Rice (San Sai)<br>ข้าวมันไก่แดน สันทราย<br>🍽️ 必比登<br>必點：海南雞飯<br>米其林必比登｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：50～200 銖/人<br>營業：約07:30-14:00（賣完即休，早點到）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dan%20Chicken%20Rice%20%28San%20Sai%29%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.041,18.859,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>★ 康托克帝王餐 Khum Khantoke</name><description><![CDATA[Khum Khantoke<br>คุ้มขันโตก<br><br>必點：Khantoke 泰北帝王餐（矮桌拼盤）＋蘭納傳統舞蹈秀<br>清邁最經典的 Khantoke 晚餐秀，必去；可在 Klook／漫清邁訂票含接送（座標為概略位置）<br>價格：570～1,000 銖/人<br>營業：約18:30-21:00（晚餐＋秀約19:15-20:15，需預約）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khum%20Khantoke%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.017,18.761,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>清萊</name><Placemark><name>Phu Lae 清萊泰北菜</name><description><![CDATA[Phu Lae Restaurant<br>ร้านอาหารภูแล<br><br>必點：泰北香腸、泰北拼盤、Khao Soi<br>清萊老字號，有冷氣、團體常去；6人先訂位<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：午餐＋晚餐<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Phu%20Lae%20Restaurant%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.835,19.9105,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Khao Soi Phor Jai 清萊咖哩麵</name><description><![CDATA[Khao Soi Phor Jai<br>ข้าวซอยพ่อใจ<br><br>必點：Khao Soi、Khanom Jeen<br>清萊最老牌 Khao Soi 之一，中午人多<br>價格：50～80 銖/人<br>營業：早上～下午<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Khao%20Soi%20Phor%20Jai%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.8325,19.905,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Lung Eed 涼拌肉末 Larb</name><description><![CDATA[Lung Eed<br>ลุงอี๊ด<br><br>必點：雞肉 Larb、烤肉<br>開了50多年的路邊老店，主打 Larb<br>價格：80～150 銖/人<br>營業：午餐～傍晚<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lung%20Eed%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.837,19.9145,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>清萊夜市</name><description><![CDATA[Chiang Rai Night Bazaar<br>ไนท์บาซาร์เชียงราย<br><br>必點：泰式火鍋 Jim Jum、燒烤、小吃<br>有美食廣場和舞台表演，走路到鐘樓看燈光秀<br>價格：100～250 銖/人<br>營業：每晚約18:00-23:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chiang%20Rai%20Night%20Bazaar%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.8345,19.9055,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>勝獅公園 Bhu Bhirom</name><description><![CDATA[Bhu Bhirom (Singha Park)<br>สิงห์ปาร์ค เชียงราย<br><br>必點：泰式料理、茶園景觀<br>茶園草地旁用餐，在回清邁的路上<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：午餐＋晚餐<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bhu%20Bhirom%20%28Singha%20Park%29%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.78,19.8667,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Chivit Thamma Da 河畔餐酒館</name><description><![CDATA[Chivit Thamma Da<br>ชีวิตธรรมดา<br><br>必點：泰式＋西式、下午茶甜點<br>河邊老洋房花園，離 Wilacha 不遠<br>價格：200～400 銖/人<br>營業：約09:00-21:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chivit%20Thamma%20Da%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.855,19.925,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>媽卡江溫泉蛋</name><description><![CDATA[Mae Kachan Hot Spring<br>บ่อน้ำพุร้อนแม่ขะจาน<br><br>必點：溫泉蛋、烤玉米<br>清邁往清萊中途休息站，自己煮溫泉蛋<br>價格：20～60 銖/人<br>營業：每日約07:00-19:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mae%20Kachan%20Hot%20Spring%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.479,19.3986,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Doi Chaang 清萊咖啡</name><description><![CDATA[Doi Chaang Coffee<br>ดอยช้าง คอฟฟี่<br><br>必點：阿卡族山區咖啡<br>清萊在地咖啡品牌，咖啡豆可當伴手禮<br>價格：60～120 銖/人<br>營業：約07:00-18:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Doi%20Chaang%20Coffee%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.833,19.9095,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>崔峰茶園下午茶</name><description><![CDATA[Choui Fong Tea Plantation<br>ไร่ชาฉุยฟง<br><br>必點：抹茶甜點、烏龍茶<br>玻璃屋看茶園梯田，清萊茶園版行程會去<br>價格：100～250 銖/人<br>營業：約08:30-17:30<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Choui%20Fong%20Tea%20Plantation%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.8,20.19,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Paa Suk 泰北米線</name><description><![CDATA[Nam Ngiao Paa Suk<br>น้ำเงี้ยวป้าสุข<br><br>必點：Khanom Jeen Nam Ngiao<br>清萊在地人愛的米線店｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：40～80 銖/人<br>營業：約07:00-16:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nam%20Ngiao%20Paa%20Suk%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.831,19.9085,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Lu Lam 清萊老店</name><description><![CDATA[Lu Lam<br>หลู้ลำ<br><br>必點：泰北菜、泰式家常菜<br>開了將近40年的平價老店｜地址依 Michelin／網路資料，地圖座標為街區概略位置<br>價格：80～200 銖/人<br>營業：10:30-21:00<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lu%20Lam%20Chiang%20Rai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.823,19.9235,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>路途中</name><Placemark><name>Cabbages &amp; Condoms 中途餐廳</name><description><![CDATA[Cabbages and Condoms Wiang Pa Pao<br>แคบเบจเอ็นคอนดอมส์ เวียงป่าเป้า<br><br>必點：泰北菜、家常炒菜<br>清邁↔清萊 118 公路上旅客與巴士常停的休息餐廳（位置為 Wiang Pa Pao 鎮上概略位置）<br>價格：150～300 銖/人<br>營業：約09:00-17:00（出發前確認）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cabbages%20and%20Condoms%20Wiang%20Pa%20Pao%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.505,19.355,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Baan Wiang 咖啡早餐</name><description><![CDATA[Baan Wiang Cafe<br>บ้านเวียง คาเฟ่<br><br>必點：粥、咖啡、早餐<br>Tripadvisor 上 Wiang Pa Pao 評價最穩定的店，早餐粥和咖啡（位置為鎮上概略位置）<br>價格：80～200 銖/人<br>營業：約07:00-17:00（出發前確認）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Baan%20Wiang%20Cafe%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.504,19.356,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Nut Pob 咖啡（媽卡江）</name><description><![CDATA[Nut Pob Coffee Cafe<br>นัท ป๊อบ คอฟฟี่<br><br>必點：咖啡、輕食<br>媽卡江溫泉旁的咖啡店，泡完溫泉蛋順便休息（位置為溫泉附近概略位置，資料較少）<br>價格：60～150 銖/人<br>營業：約08:00-17:00（出發前確認）<br>https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nut%20Pob%20Coffee%20Cafe%20Chiang%20Mai&hl=en]]></description><Point><coordinates>99.478,19.399,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>清邁（位置未確認）</name></Folder></Document></kml>
